eo></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/70086ed89785032fb4486d6bf7780db0.avif?t=1754514725\" width=610 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your village in dynamic real-time battles. Protect your settlement, master your weapons, and fight for your people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/eda0e749e8263cd11868456ccb634189.poster.avif?t=1754514725\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/eda0e749e8263cd11868456ccb634189.webm?t=1754514725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/eda0e749e8263cd11868456ccb634189.mp4?t=1754514725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/f92be4d3d414159911e285d19fbfe71e.avif?t=1754514725\" width=610 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send out trade caravans to distant towns, build trade routes, and strengthen your economic power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/94bb56e6443fe6bc8a636cb4d04d3576.avif?t=1754514725\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/dad44478859afae754c5395bd731c672.avif?t=1754514725\" width=610 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dialogue choices will influence the world around you. Every decision writes your legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/bc8a3b34587f9ea619605ce616fecff0.poster.avif?t=1754514725\" width=774 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/bc8a3b34587f9ea619605ce616fecff0.webm?t=1754514725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/bc8a3b34587f9ea619605ce616fecff0.mp4?t=1754514725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/ecea0ffb20b910f967a31773595fbeae.avif?t=1754514725\" width=610 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how your city gradually expands and evolves from the first building to a large medieval settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/d522df7540aef2b766dfb5ceed132296.avif?t=1754514725\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/35731ef5abd91598ce05a19ccac73ded.avif?t=1754514725\" width=610 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience realistic day-night cycles and changing weather conditions that shape the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/efcf3153d59b305203b37e323b2dbda8.poster.avif?t=1754514725\" width=770 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/efcf3153d59b305203b37e323b2dbda8.webm?t=1754514725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/efcf3153d59b305203b37e323b2dbda8.mp4?t=1754514725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/a080d4adf98fde7f533b6f9c0ead4866.avif?t=1754514725\" width=610 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community on Discord to follow development updates and get early access to playtests. Find the link in the right panel of the Steam page!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504490/extras/cac6363a371593dcebbe6fbf46fb123b.avif?t=1754514725\" width=800 height=225 /></span></p>",
